  <item>
    <title>27 - 聊专场repo，张骏竟被观众当场点评…</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f174942adfe48b83e0b530</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f174942adfe48b83e0b530</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Sep 2024 18:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>张骏（@张骏coolhorse）：我真的很喜欢这件事，希望在这件事上得到认可</span><br><span>大Z（@开饭喜剧大Z）：有个观众repo我讲了三年的老段子？</span><br><span>丁懒（@布丁不懒）：看男生被定义打分，有种报仇的快感。</span><br><span>​良辰（@良辰有点沉）：期待自己被网暴</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 我在豆瓣被打了一星。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> 武汉差评report</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 终于看到男人被打分了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 小佳转发张骏差评</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1247">20:47</a> 我觉得自己不配发专场repo</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 第一次线下看张骏，觉得不好笑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 关于演员不换段子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2544">42:24</a> 对张骏说加油</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2956">49:16</a> 没有差评我感到有点不安</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3243">54:03</a> 问张骏，刷到差评vs说你丑，哪个更难受</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3681">61:21</a> 愿意花多少钱看专场​</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgLaeuYq_6TKEnNuBZNWgJCECuu9.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhNnFuy8cVE-ST4aj1LdR89tvd5S.m4a" length="97548553" type="audio/mp4"/>
