  <item>
    <title>26 - 副业，就当婚外情搞</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e834053a5ff0a0cad81cf1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e834053a5ff0a0cad81cf1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2024 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>良辰（@良辰有点沉）：为了钱工作，不如直接饿死</span><br><span>大Z（@开饭喜剧大Z）：搞副业遇到做小卡片的</span><br><span>小八（@小八小八就会哈哈）：为了副业真的辞掉了主业</span><br><span>丁懒（@布丁不懒）：多个副业多条腿奔向人生的旷野</span><br><span>欣然（@小太阳吧扎嘿）：我就是想做二房东</span><br><span>阿腌（@酌妍腌腌）：五块也是钱，能挣就挣</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">5:30</a> 我开的不是副业，我开的是副食</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a> 兔八哥居然还有女朋友？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 为了副业我把公务员都辞掉了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 这个脏钱，得挣啊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1601">26:41</a> &nbsp;我和你们不一样，我的副业是当中介</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 20块钱刮刮乐没中我都很难过了就别提副业了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 录制现场差点变成投资招商会</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 我可以给你构建一个游戏世界</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2827">47:07</a> 都花那么多钱学飞盘了，能不能赚回来呢？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">53:50</a> 教培副业让我对小孩的印象发生了很大的改变</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3563">59:23</a> 我来给观众按摩，你来给观众讲脱口秀可好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3868">1:04:28</a> 饭圈真的很赚钱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhaUXXXDaCfLJuwQqV0i0m4Squc0.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll_n9i2SCF3za8rNAfQBYTBk1t6_.m4a" length="100879901" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtGgx7vkecKOOpzFHHdL2y2KY6X8.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>26</itunes:episode>
