  <item>
    <title>25 - 我们关系这么好，拿把刀跟你聊聊很正常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ded97cee04007d8846d976</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ded97cee04007d8846d976</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Sep 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从武汉的暴躁传说到亲密关系的硝烟战场</span><br><span>从虎牙的“武汉出租车惊魂记”到吴鼎与老爸的“拳击赛”</span><br><span>从良辰与好友的每年“生日必打”到小八家“五妈舞刀”</span><br><span>快来听听大家如何处理亲密关系里的“小爆炸”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播 ：</span><br><span>吴鼎（@吴鼎顶不住了）：继承了我爸的缺点，但等到了他的道歉。</span><br><span>虎牙（@单口喜剧演员虎牙）：想跟小八老师学骂人。</span><br><span>良辰（@良辰有点沉）：逃避冲突就是逃避问题！</span><br><span>小八（@小八小八就会哈哈）​：冲突很难避免，建议直接对骂！</span><br><span>丁懒（@布丁不懒）​：吵架就该用Ai录音（此处招商）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> 虎牙偶遇武汉暴躁的士司机</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> 即兴演绎如何应对不良司机（优美武汉话版</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a> 小八分享五妈舞刀</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1614">26:54</a> 吴鼎与父亲的冲突</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 他打过他爸，我打过我妈</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 武汉观众现砸吴鼎饭碗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2638">43:58</a> 和奇葩说资深爱好者吵架</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 亲密关系管理只能靠陈鹤皋的无限制格斗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3058">50:58</a> 每次吵架都会做拿录音笔做记录</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3422">57:02</a> 女友用指尖让我情绪软着陆（外加上呼吸道感染</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvF9PHOrs_PTBlI48r0rYpB3GZ3E.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljP2ASudKvVe4yULmPuxqRSzGEy-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lklU6AmtBa0FbrdXw2y3UFOWNkju.m4a" length="97111581" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtGgx7vkecKOOpzFHHdL2y2KY6X8.jpg"/>
