  <item>
    <title>还是说谎吧，你说的真话不好听啊…</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b9ea0233591c27be83ad33</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b9ea0233591c27be83ad33</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2024 10:54:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>说谎，是不是每个人都玩过的小把戏？</span><br><span>我们不藏着掖着，不Judge，只Share，聊聊那些年我们说过的谎​</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播:</span><br><span>Dankia@Dankia：谎言是应对压力的一种方式</span><br><span>良辰@良辰有点沉：谎话说多了，想找找真实的自己</span><br><span>大Z@开饭喜剧大Z：妈妈说谈恋爱就要把缺点都藏起来</span><br><span>丁懒@布丁不懒：真相会过期，也因人而异</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 康德——该不该对杀人犯撒谎？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> 被人打劫的时候我说谎了... </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 我会为了那个好处说谎</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> 忘不了口语考试时候的说谎</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> 关于谎言的三个基本假设</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a> 我不会说谎，但我会不回复</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">42:42</a> 如何鉴谎</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2782">46:22</a> 在天津撒谎说相声被当众揭穿</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3046">50:46</a> 演出海报上的美人居然是... </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3340">55:40</a> 谎言是必要的</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：DV</span><br><span>剪辑：小门</span><br><span>制作：DV</span><br><span>录音：易言</span><br><span>现场：小贺</span><br><span>审核：开饭喜剧新媒体部</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSF3E7zAIbrJoxTo6Pkao_GXwox.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
