  <item>
    <title>20-收了神通吧，别再爹爹不休了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b09daf7349f7a557e00d93</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b09daf7349f7a557e00d93</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Aug 2024 09:38:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这个社会太“爹”啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>爹分为小爹、大爹、活爹、男爹、女爹...</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个似乎人人都能"教"你点什么的时代，“爹味”到底是不是devil！？让我们一起来聊聊吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span><br><span>DV：我为什么一定需要别人的建议呢？</span><br><span>阿彦：是可以，不是应该！</span><br><span>大Z：这一期精彩程度，奇葩说也就那样</span><br><span>丁懒：辈亲爹“爹”最难受</span><br><span></span><br><span>Timeline:</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 你怎么定义爹味？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a> 上知网查爹味看到的是... </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a> 我在青藤之恋上遇到的活爹们</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a> 看谁都爹那没有可能是你太巨婴了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1881">31:21</a> “应该”两个字太爹了，律师表示... </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 我是一个被爹buff叠满的人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2743">45:43</a> 爹认为自己是永恒正确的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2999">49:59</a> 被爹了该怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：大Z</span><br><span>剪辑：小门</span><br><span>制作：DV</span><br><span>文案：丁懒</span><br><span>录音：易言</span><br><span>现场：小贺</span><br><span>审核：开饭喜剧新媒体部</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSF3E7zAIbrJoxTo6Pkao_GXwox.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
