  <item>
    <title>19-省钱也别这么省啊？你这都是偷了吧？！！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a7c60d33ddcbb53cf4e66b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a7c60d33ddcbb53cf4e66b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jul 2024 16:40:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>外卖价涨心不慌，省钱秘籍来帮忙。</span><br><span>不必摧残精神肉体，不必牺牲生活质量，我们追求的是聪 明消费，理智节省。</span><br><span>骂骂美团，逛逛闲鱼，意外受伤省钱第一步是拨打120，别让小省变大损！</span><br><span>快来听听省钱故事，调整省钱姿势！</span></p><span></span><p><span>​本期主播</span><br><span>良辰@良辰有点沉：杜绝有钱硬省，人活着就要对自己好一点。</span><br><span>文小远：我觉得人就不应该省钱！</span><br><span>大Z@开饭喜剧大Z：今天偷感怎么这么重，不要为了省钱破坏法律啊！</span><br><span>丁懒@布丁不懒：可以买贵的，但不能买贵了。可以省钱，不能省人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间线：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> : 省钱就是摧残自己，不是肉体就是精神。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a>：PUA美团，美团你再这样子，以后再也不用你了。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="401">06:41</a>：观众省钱tips分享闲鱼购，零元购，私域购...</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a>：人就不应该省钱，我们要让钱流动起来好吗！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a>：睡过机场的我觉得住贵的酒店更省钱。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a>: 我好羡慕他，住30块钱酒店还能带伴侣。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a>：这种是省，那种是抠，我列了提纲。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a>：遇到过一个超级抠男！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2418">40:18</a>：拿学驾照的3000去学了吉他后...</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a>：因为省钱，现在我腿里有一个钢板，三个钢钉。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2965">49:25</a>：被我爸省过钱，他说生女孩子省钱。</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3481">58:01</a>：我妈给我记了一个账本，累计下来将近62万左右</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后给大家带来一个小彩蛋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvfcfRlhFbv5ziajFx59yQUr-A2Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>​大家说说，抱吉他的姿势像不像3000块钱</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：大Z</span><br><span>剪辑：小门</span><br><span>制作：DV</span><br><span>录音：易言</span><br><span>现场：小贺</span><br><span>审核：开饭喜剧新媒体部</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSF3E7zAIbrJoxTo6Pkao_GXwox.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltf0pgUGNtesz_xXwg6g7-mVjQna.m4a" length="87787237" type="audio/mp4"/>
