  <item>
    <title>18-萝卜快跑！和武汉人聊聊困在资本算法里的司机</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669e5ac037236c546ef13440</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669e5ac037236c546ef13440</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Jul 2024 13:12:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello，朋友们！这一期我们聊【萝卜快跑】！武汉街头的无人驾驶新宠。是噱头还是未来？AI司机真的能取代人类司机吗？是时候告别传统出租车，还是萝卜快跑尚未成熟？从技术革新到人文关怀，畅谈“萝卜”带来的种种，你准备好上车了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播</span><br><span>DV@davidtwitter：萝卜快跑里面就该安个洗脸盆</span><br><span>良辰@良辰有点沉：期待人工智能可以尽快取代劣质人工</span><br><span>大Z@开饭喜剧大Z：我的伞被撕碎过，我也要替他们打一顶</span><br><span>丁懒@布丁不懒：阻止不了萝卜跑，以后的萝卜还会飞</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>时间轴：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 武汉的出租车司机风评不好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> 我被AI取代过</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 如果一定要在女人男人机器人中选的话</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 人工智能发展到现在，它应该停一停</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 我选武汉司机</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 如果萝卜比人还智能，你们还会支持人类司机吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">28:18</a> 工具是工具，用什么工具取决于你</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2063">34:23</a> 的士收费太便宜了，应该把价格抬高</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 司机只为挣钱，不是热爱，需要萝卜打破这个环境</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2468">41:08</a> 解放那么多生产力，生产力去哪儿</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2678">44:38</a> AI 只取代中低端的话，我很痛苦</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3028">50:28</a> 选择的权利还在人的手上</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3319">55:19</a> 我见证了萝卜的发展</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3607">1:00:07</a> 科技发展的同时，社会人文关怀缺席</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3903">1:05:03</a> 第一个想法是在我车里装一个洗脸盆</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4332">1:12:12</a> 人在用AI剥削人，缺德的永远是人</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>策划：大Z</span><br><span>剪辑：小门</span><br><span>制作：DV</span><br><span>录音：易言</span><br><span>现场：小贺</span><br><span>审核：开饭喜剧新媒体部</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSF3E7zAIbrJoxTo6Pkao_GXwox.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmkHtTxD35n06-NW4pEIQ5Jrx2Yb.m4a" length="108221681" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtGgx7vkecKOOpzFHHdL2y2KY6X8.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>18</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>17-屡次收到差评，他们竟…</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6694bb1d8fcadceb90648743</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6694bb1d8fcadceb90648743</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2024 03:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目有小强出没，</span><br><span>有甜咸信仰之争，</span><br><span>有引起众怒的某超市，</span><br><span>有道德与法制小插曲，</span><br><span>更有对武汉交通的复杂感情...</span><br><span>差评是对痛苦的释放？差评并不能真的伤害到我?</span><br><span>不需要再在意别人的评价就好了？让我们一起来聊聊吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span><br><span>DV@davidtwitter：我是有信仰的人，和我的信仰不同一律差评</span><br><span>大楷@大楷是楷书的楷：我没有写差评，我展示了一个幽默</span><br><span>大Z@开饭喜剧大Z：我给差评讲究一个积德</span><br><span>丁懒@布丁不懒：写差评被赞，虚荣心得到了满足</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>时间轴：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 即使有蟑螂也不会给差评</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a> 免单的心动</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 腌笃鲜有青笋！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a> 去成都在大众点评告诉他我喜欢女人</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 给警察打差评</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 被大学生去市场监督局举报</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1206">20:06</a> 过年的时候那个超市太可恶了！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 武汉市出租车举报电话是多少</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 给老师99.7分后我被挂科了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2022">33:42</a> 怕被开除天天跟学生说不要举报我</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2202">36:42</a> 我不能让别人给我打差评我要成为一个圣母</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> 地铁站内不能上厕所</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2767">46:07</a> 卖光剑被俄罗斯人的评价吓哭了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3047">50:47</a> 我那学法的朋友就等着这一刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3388">56:28</a> DJ版的凤凰传奇废了他两张信用卡</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>策划：大Z</span><br><span>剪辑：小门</span><br><span>制作：DV</span><br><span>文案：丁懒</span><br><span>录音：易言</span><br><span>现场：小贺</span><br><span>审核：开饭喜剧新媒体部</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSF3E7zAIbrJoxTo6Pkao_GXwox.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>策划：大Z</span><br><span>剪辑：小门</span><br><span>制作：大Z</span><br><span>录音：易言</span><br><span>现场：小贺</span><br><span>审核：开饭喜剧新媒体部</span></p>]]></description>
