  <item>
    <title>16-避雷！开饭喜剧竟然有这么多“瘾”君子</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668c64018fcadceb90ef6407</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">668c64018fcadceb90ef6407</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jul 2024 04:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvSF3E7zAIbrJoxTo6Pkao_GXwox.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Hello，朋友们！</span><br><span>这一期我们聊【瘾】</span><br><span>这次大家分享了各种瘾。</span><br><span>有对麻辣烫的不可描述之爱、有偷偷吃糖的小秘密、还有那些对大猪蹄子的狂热追求。</span><br><span>有沉迷于爬楼梯、擦屏幕、甚至买充电头的“小怪瘾”。</span><br><span>有人竟然对“戒爱”上瘾，还有人对“不上瘾”上瘾！</span><br><span>最酷的是有人对“性别的缺点”上瘾!</span><br><span>我们聊了“小众瘾”带来的羞耻感、“禁忌瘾”带来的偷乐感、“怕上瘾”带来的安全感。</span><br><span>听别人的瘾私......，很过瘾哈哈哈哈。</span><br><span>准备好了吗？让我们一起开始吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span><br><span>DavidV@davidtwitter： &nbsp;喝酒不丢人，喝完才丢人</span><br><span>阿彦@日思夜想的彦子哥：你这就是在戒赌吧上岸了</span><br><span>大Z@开饭喜剧大Z： 我不允许你变得很好，武大学生</span><br><span>丁懒@布丁不懒：地铁上的男人都对张腿坐有瘾</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 把偷吃描述成了偷情的感觉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> 知乎上分享小众零食几万赞</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 上瘾触发强制戒断</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1308">21:48</a> 我不允许你变得更好，武大学生</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">29:33</a> 对什么感到羞耻？对别人的眼光</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1930">32:10</a> 男人的自信就不管人家</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a> 对带有性别的缺点会上瘾</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> 地铁上男人永远张开腿坐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2138">35:38</a> 社会上对女性道德要求太高</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2316">38:36</a> 最后再戒赌，就上岸了你</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 是男人就上100层是吧</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a> 沉迷于买充电头</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3086">51:26</a> 太迷恋一个东西，我就会把它断掉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3297">54:57</a> 一天不擦我就不爽</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3384">56:24</a> 到底是瘾还是强迫症</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：丁懒</span><br><span>剪辑：小门</span><br><span>制作：大Z</span><br><span>录音：易言</span><br><span>现场：小贺</span><br><span>审核：开饭喜剧新媒体部</span></p>]]></description>
