  <item>
    <title>13–借我一双慧眼吧，骗子实在是防不胜防</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652deb7949f5d02b0d54f22f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">652deb7949f5d02b0d54f22f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Oct 2023 02:03:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>本期主播：</span><br><span>大Z@大Z菌：充了黄钻就可以看留言了呀</span><br><span>森林@你去森林里啊：我只是了解一下，它如果不对，我立刻就出来</span><br><span>David@Davidtwitter：我就是很喜欢追问细节</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;前段时间《孤注一掷》真的太火了。脑袋瓜不聪明的大Z为了防止自己被拐卖到缅北，特意去学习了一番。回到俱乐部一交流，发现很多同伴都有被诈骗，甚至找工作不小心进入诈骗公司的。一问他业绩有多少，结果饭吃的太多被赶出来了。（最后一句是假的啦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;哪怕演员学历高（三本也是本科啦），也还是逃不了被诈骗的魔爪。大学时期铺天盖地的刷单码字兼职，也是针对大学生小（精）而（准）美的诈骗。几百块钱也是钱！！！在大学被骗走几百块钱简直心都在滴血好吧！很难想象那些被骗去没有去码字刷单赚钱的大学生到底存不存在。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;恩格斯曾经说过，当利润达到300%，他们敢冒着绞刑的危险。而诈骗，成本几近为零，利润爆表，绞刑架大概率最终也套不到他们的头上，所以诈骗来势汹汹，铺天盖地。</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在这个电影放映周期的尾声，想和你们聊聊，也许大家被骗的不止是钱财。被迫去面试刷业绩，被异性花言巧语骗去感情，也许你就是被妈妈骗走了压岁钱。想在今夜和你一起聊聊，一起下载反诈APP！！！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>策划：大Z</span><br><span>制作：David</span><br><span>录音：Versace</span><br><span>审核：开饭喜剧新媒体部</span><br><span>社群：啾啾</span><br><span>音乐：</span><em><strong><span>Team Work by Corporate Music Zone |</span></strong></em><a href="https://corporate-music-zone.bandcamp.com/" data-url="https://corporate-music-zone.bandcamp.com/"><em><strong><span>corporate-music-zone.bandcamp.com</span></strong></em></a><em><strong><br><span>Music promoted by </span></strong></em><a href="https://www.free-stock-music.com/" data-url="https://www.free-stock-music.com/"><em><strong><span>www.free-stock-music.com</span></strong></em></a><em><strong><br><span>Smooth Operator By Sade</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Timeline:</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="371">6:11</a> 谁还看不出来这是在诈骗嘛</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a>他们就主打一个陪伴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a> 天下没有免费的馅饼</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 我当时差点就信了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 10块钱的Q币！10块钱的Q币</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 这个暑假我什么都没干，马化腾白赚20块</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 他好爱我，哭死</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 我也有一个表哥</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 说不定以后还可以找他去玩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a> 你也会被骗吗？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3448">57:28</a> 那个人，化成灰我都认得他</span></blockquote>]]></description>
